{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And his offering.</b> The verse added a vav from the beginning of the matter, for according to what we explained in the passage ״הַמַּקְרִיב אֶת קָרְבָּנוֹ״ — since he intends toward the hidden realm — it is fitting to say, in remembrance of the revealed realm, <b>and his offering.</b> Also according to the other approaches, the verse added in it a vav to allude to the superiority that is in this righteous man, exceedingly lofty and exalted."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:06:31.883933153Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}